{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00309","headline":"奉和御制麟德殿宴百僚应制 · 尚宫宋氏若昭","name":"奉和御制麟德殿宴百僚应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"垂衣临八极，肃穆四门通。\n自是无爲化，非关辅弼功。\n修文招隐伏，尚武殄妖凶。\n德炳韶光炽，恩沾雨露浓。\n衣冠陪御宴，礼乐盛朝宗。\n万寿称觞举，千年信一同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尚宫宋氏若昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00309.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00309","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}